      "uid": "zhcn:984f351ddd5ee50d562803f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『RDLI』。\r\n是一款让玩家们组队共同战斗的FPS游戏，\r\n卖点是能够运用多种多样的武器来战胜对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ea894ce7aebb622a75d860dfcc3f978d3f87d5ed5a0781de09067a81851cba2",
