      "uid": "zhcn:1b30c93ecc413dd1b23302d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『RDLI』啊……\r\n虽然感觉周围所有人都没玩，\r\n只有我是一个玩家的样子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d011589d0bf34521e52de4c166e44cb0e9093709536bfde626edd5615d7e265",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
