      "uid": "zhcn:8cc75e705f4010af25d015d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "按照她的室友、超级溪流提供的情报——\r\n大进似乎一直找不到对战的对手。\r\n既然这样的话，就由我来陪她一起玩游戏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a2205ddc0fac8785ce34e857a91648b1dbcf941c98b5220bbf4527a0da88ab2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1050/storytimeline_501050703.json",
      "json_path": [
